  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0009","literal","The prince's second brother Zhong was established in Dai.","He then established his second brother Zhong as king in Dai.","Chinese 而王次兄仲於代 continues Gaozu as subject making Zhong king in Dai; the literal wrongly frames Zhong as 'the prince's second brother' and loses causative 王.","high","applied"],
    ["s0030","literal","Empress Gao established Lü Lü as king in Zhao, and after one year Empress Gao passed away.","Empress Gao established Lü Lu as king in Zhao, and after one year Empress Gao passed away.","Chinese 呂祿 is surname 呂 (Lǚ) plus given name 祿 (Lù); literal 'Lü Lü' misreads the given name.","high","applied"],
    ["s0031","literal","The ministers executed the various Lü clansmen including Lü Lü, and established King You's son Sui as King of Zhao.","The ministers executed the various Lü clansmen including Lü Lu, and established King You's son Sui as King of Zhao.","Same as s0030: 呂祿 should be Lü Lu, not Lü Lü.","high","applied"]
  ],
